# Web (Vite) build-time environment.
# Copy to `.env.production` (or set these in your host's build settings) to
# override the API root for the SPA build.
#
# Default (leave unset) => same-origin "/api", which is what the single-container
# Docker image serves (Express hosts both the API and the built SPA).
#
# Only set VITE_API_URL for SPLIT hosting, where the SPA is on a CDN/static host
# and the API runs on a different domain. Must be the FULL API root including /api.
# It is inlined at build time, so rebuild the SPA after changing it, and add the
# SPA origin to the server's CORS_ORIGIN allow-list.
#
# VITE_API_URL="https://api.yourdomain.com/api"
